          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.9"/>
          <code code="51847-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Assessment and Plan"/>
          <title>Assessment and Plan</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>72yo F with AFib s/p recent GI bleed from NSAID+warfarin interaction. CHADSVASc score 4 (high stroke risk). Recent echo shows mild LA enlargement, EF 55%. Patient hesitant about warfarin after recent bleed. Discussed risks/benefits of anticoagulation. Given CKD (eGFR 52), DOACs would require dose adjustment. Decided to restart warfarin with closer INR monitoring. Added aspirin 81mg for additional cardioprotection given stroke risk. Patient also has h/o CAD (diagnosed today based on old records review showing prior stent 2018), so aspirin indicated. Continue omeprazole for GI protection while on dual antiplatelet/anticoagulation.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
